  "path_redaction": "Only the absolute workspace prefix in permission-rules.log changed, in 1 field, to <fixture-workspace>. Its source and export hashes are distinct. Every other file is byte-identical to its source commit. The trace is published as recorded: its program_artifacts section names the four program binaries by their absolute paths on the machine that ran it.",
  "source_files": "The three files under source/foundation/onchain/ are the build inputs whose hashes are not already published, copied byte for byte at the program_source commit. Their SHA-256 values equal the entries for the same paths in the trace's build_inputs. Seven other build inputs are identical to files under ../delivery-rules/source/, one to a file under ../early-settlement/source/, one to a file under ../pinned-price/source/ and the remaining 59 to files under ../source/. The base commit's program source is the program source of the delivery-rules record. The files retain their existing copyright, and this release adds no license grant for them."
